      "version": "1.1.0",
      "title": "AllAuth React SDK 1.1.0: portable authentication and managed branding",
      "summary": "The earliest retained allowlisted archive contains portable cookie-based React authentication and a same-origin app proxy.",
      "notes": [
        "Includes AllAuthProvider, SignIn, SignUp, password recovery, UserButton, UserProfile and OrganizationSwitcher components backed by native sessions.",
        "Loads public application branding and authentication capabilities through the app's same-origin configuration endpoint.",
        "Provides an optional Better Auth UI integration and the Next.js server proxy without requiring Next.js for the portable React components."
